; VGM Analyzer MML for OPNAvoid (PMD-style dialect), tick-exact
; Source: 05 Fun.vgm
; YM2608 FM/SSG/ADPCM/rhythm on the song's own Timer B ticks: T213 = 201.550 BPM, 24 ticks per quarter.
